    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear that, but it feels like a way to sugarcoat it. i look at the data, the actual history of my family, and it's so consistent. it doesn't feel like a map i can change, it feels like a biological command. like my brain is literally wired to fail or just give up eventually. how can i \"rewrite\" something that is literally part of my cells?",
