      "content": "it just feels so exhausting to fight something so fundamental. if the biology is already set, then all this \"choosing\" and \"rewriting\" is just dragging out the inevitable. it's like trying to argue with gravity. if the end is already decided by my genes, isn't there more dignity in just accepting it than in fighting a losing battle for decades?",
